<title>SWITZERLAND: ATHLETICS-GEBRSELASSIE BREAKS 5,000M WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-GEBRSELASSIE BREAKS 5,000M WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopian Haile Gebrselassie broke the men's 5,000 metres world record when he clocked an unofficial time of 12 minutes 41.86 seconds at the Zurich grand prix athletics meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It beat the old mark of 12:44.39 which he set himself in Zurich in August 1995.</p>
